# Secrets: the operator runbook creates deploy/.env.production inside the repo,
# which is the build context for Dockerfile.web and services/scout/Dockerfile.
# Without these patterns a `docker build` would bake real credentials into the
# build-context upload and every COPY layer that spans the tree.
.env
.env.*
deploy/.env.production
backups/
